{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your own quest to never lose again in\u00a0<i>Shoresy: Legends of the North</i>. This pick-up-and-play hockey RPG is a love letter to the golden age of sports games.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRESS A to SHOOT &amp; HIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/62da71c8fbbda582c265a506e8efaafc.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/62da71c8fbbda582c265a506e8efaafc.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/62da71c8fbbda582c265a506e8efaafc.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>HIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/863652eb13bd55a424f9f3bb41deca2a.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/863652eb13bd55a424f9f3bb41deca2a.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/863652eb13bd55a424f9f3bb41deca2a.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRESS B to PASS </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/ec42765112e0efe753ea1586c71c5003.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/ec42765112e0efe753ea1586c71c5003.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/ec42765112e0efe753ea1586c71c5003.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRIGGERS to BOOST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b9398de0035a4855b7f9bd803d3f7e9d.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b9398de0035a4855b7f9bd803d3f7e9d.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b9398de0035a4855b7f9bd803d3f7e9d.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE HAVE TWO DISTINCT GAME MODES:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEVEL UP AND SAVE THE WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on the\u00a0Sudbury Blueberry Bulldogs\u00a0sweater in the original narrative-driven story and play alongside Shoresy on an epic hockey adventure to defeat the legendary Hockey Godz. Create your own character, level up your stats, and unlock new gear in this hockey RPG campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/f9e2da1e80c0ca030492672281c1bfbd.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>PLAY SOME HOCKEY </strong><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/a740d70c1a1c1bf7113e2a8609b0d5f6.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <strong>DRIVE ACROSS THE COUNTRY</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/c6901217b7b1d80abad4898c4103160a.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MANAGE YOUR GEAR </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/987c367075c8e4a4aa34efd6955e13c5.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 /></span><strong>BATTLE THE BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1e548149980081088426b9ad70d19ae6.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EXPERIENCE THE WORLD OF SHORESY</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/84f9638ee8d93959bc0156fc33a5f629.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 /></span><strong>LEVEL UP YOUR TEAM</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/1f10d26566f6fabd6804bbd75550c42a.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHINNY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER: COMPETITIVE, and CO-OP.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go head-to-head with friends in the local multiplayer Shinny Mode\u00a0by drafting your team of fan-favourite characters to run \u2018em up and fill \u2018em in. Charge your fight meter to knock out your rivals or\u00a0grab\u00a0a power-up to gain an edge. Works with Steam remote play for online fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A REASON TO GET TOGETHER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1770777561\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1770777561 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You ready? Good, \u2018cause you\u2019re going!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1770777561\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1770777561 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHORESY</i>,</strong> created by and starring Jared Keeso and produced by New Metric Media in association with Play Fun Games and Crave, sees the titular character Shoresy (Keeso) and the Sudbury Bulldogs of the Northern Ontario Senior Hockey Organization (The NOSHO) on a quest to never lose again. SHORESY returned for season four on Crave in Canada in January, and Hulu in the US in February, with seasons one through three streaming on the platforms, as well. The fifth season of the series completed production in April, with a premiere date to be announced.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1538010?t=1770777561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/88c4d908093042493a04a5551eb8ebf3f30822e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770777561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/12a5951b4d5fdb00396076dcfd17568ed27e0a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770777561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/12a5951b4d5fdb00396076dcfd17568ed27e0a21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770777561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"descriptio