\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/72fcaf3450ad8deaf2f2ac54df2d3b7c.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A REASON TO GET TOGETHER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.poster.avif?t=1770777561\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.webm?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/6d1768079ed30ecc53d046b1295e6ac7.mp4?t=1770777561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1770777561\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/542a09016fb86b2425b4fec313d62518.avif?t=1770777561 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You ready? Good, \u2018cause you\u2019re going!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1770777561\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1770777561 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHORESY</i>,</strong> created by and starring Jared Keeso and produced by New Metric Media in association with Play Fun Games and Crave, sees the titular character Shoresy (Keeso) and the Sudbury Bulldogs of the Northern Ontario Senior Hockey Organization (The NOSHO) on a quest to never lose again. SHORESY returned for season four on Crave in Canada in January, and Hulu in the US in February, with seasons one through three streaming on the platforms, as well. The fifth season of the series completed production in April, with a premiere date to be announced.</p>","developers":["Treewood Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/fdb1389fe3c53b4cf138d4aad765eb0dcf99bce7/header.jpg?t=1770777561","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Shoresy Gameco Inc.<br />\r\n\u00a9 2024 Treewood Studios Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 64 + Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1538010/1108354053/6b43df2edfd3e244ffc55ebfee15e4fb7bfffda4/1770672771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770686678","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store